---
alwaysApply: true
---
When adding shadcn/ui components to the project, always use the command:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add [component_name]
```

**Examples:**
```bash
npx shadcn@latest add button
npx shadcn@latest add card
npx shadcn@latest add dialog
npx shadcn@latest add form
```

**Important Notes:**
- Replace `[component_name]` with the actual component name (e.g., button, card, dialog)
- Ensure you're in the project root directory before running the command
- The command will automatically configure the component according to your project's setup
- Components will be installed in the configured components directory (usually `./components/ui/`)

